	<ouc:properties label="metadata">
		<title>Computer and Information Sciences | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="Launch your tech career with Lake Tahoe Community College’s IT Technician – Cybersecurity program. Gain hands-on skills in desktop support, system administration, information security, and cybersecurity. Prepare for entry- to mid-level roles in today’s high-demand IT industry with our degree and certificate options. Start building your future in tech today!" />
	</ouc:properties>

